## Worksheet

**F1**: GameState class w/ mulberry32(seed) rng; processTurn() calls consumeNeeds→updateMorale→processProduction→...→checkGameOver in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2**: 8x8 map via generateMap() using this.rng(); canBuildAt() checks terrain reqs; getAdjacencyBonus() feeds outMult in processProduction(). Score 2.

**F3**: power→water/metal/scrip, water→food chains in processProduction; resourceCaps enforced with overflow event logged. Score 2.

**F4**: colonists have skillLevel, fatigue, morale, buildingAssignments; both skillLevel and fatigue read in processProduction's outMult. Score 2.

**F5**: consumeNeeds() tracks shortage; updateMorale() applies -15 delta; moraleFactor used in production; fatigue/morale both recoverable. Score 2.

**F6**: 8 nodes in initResearch; prereq checked in completeResearch; but mining-tools/smelting/hydroponics have no coded effect (only 5/8 do). Score 1.

**F7**: only 4 events in processEvents array (need 10+), uniform (not weighted) selection, no choices, no cooldown tracking. Score 1.

**F8**: tradeWith() buy/sell work, caravan qty decrements; but globalSupplyDrift starts as `{}` and is never seeded, so its for-in loop never runs — prices never actually drift. Score 1.

**F9**: processAshstorms sets lastAshstorm=turn before computing severity, so severity is always 1 (bug); building.health never read in processProduction; no repair function exists anywhere. Score 1.

**F10**: serialize()/deserialize() with textarea copy UI; loadFromText() catches JSON errors and alerts "Invalid: ...". Score 2.

**F11**: checkGameOver() has reachable WIN (turn≥60,pop≥12,food/water>50) and LOSE (pop=0); calculateScore() uses multiple fields; showGameOverModal() renders summary. Score 2.

**F12**: renderTabs() switching; log entries show `[${entry.turn}]`; tile tooltips show health/adj%; keydown handler for Space and 1-6; @media(max-width:600px) present. Score 2.

**F13**: runTests() checks 11 real invariants (caps, prereqs, ranges, roundtrip); runBenchmark() runs 200 turns headless via testGame.processTurn() and prints stateHash(). Score 2.

**G1**: research effects only touch resourceCaps/one-time additions (advanced-farming→cap, fusion-core→one-time power); processProduction's outMult never reads any research flag. Score 1.

**G2**: consumeNeeds→foodConsumed=false→updateMorale(-15)→colonist.morale→moraleFactor in processProduction outMult. Fully wired every turn. Score 4.

**G3**: processAshstorms damages buildings[key].health, but processProduction never reads building.health, and no repair() function exists anywhere. Score 1.

**G4**: tradePrices update loop in generateCaravanInventory() iterates `this.globalSupplyDrift` which is permanently `{}` — never executes, prices stay static. Score 1.

**G5**: processEvents' 4 events all auto-apply via impact() with zero player-facing choice buttons; no event ever branches on player input. Score 0.

